{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0454_1000_p", "source_sha256": "1547c1a03bc40a716f3e8a8a8c7640916de94e66dfb326690e0c29117e71bd17", "ja": "（今日は歩の仕事に付き添う日だ。\nもうすぐ出発の時間だけど、歩の姿は……）", "zh": "（今天是陪步去工作的日子。\n马上就要出发了，可步她……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0454_1001_034ayu", "source_sha256": "709b2c79101be6bb94c622d520e8f023cf83058892445fdddba3b37a8a92b38f", "ja": "お待たせ、{$P$}！\n時間、間に合った！？", "zh": "让你久等了，{$P$}！\n时间赶上了吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0454_1002_p", "source_sha256": "503778c9c27e7874272fe0c0c24b2b3eb3827bbddaa0bf9375f46104a7528440", "ja": "ああ、大丈夫だよ。\nこの時間なら、余裕で現場に着きそうだ。", "zh": "啊，没事的。照这个时间来看，应该能提前赶到现场。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0454_1003_034ayu", "source_sha256": "3b651bf8db7bddc5df03116feb3e823147d8974b650afe49e7b9e1a4871a4f5b", "ja": "よ、よかったぁ～……！　色々やってたら、\n思ってたより時間かかっちゃってさ……。", "zh": "太、太好了～……！忙这忙那的，不知不觉就比想的花了更多时间……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0454_1004_p", "source_sha256": "826e3fb7b1822237c6f85710cd12fda7898cbfc1334c30e936616d54a18ff588", "ja": "色々？", "zh": "各种各样的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0454_1005_034ayu", "source_sha256": "c79a5c58b2d97ae2152eaa5996d46ddc6e57d745c95afbca232f1572a9aa66d4", "ja": "そ、色々。ねえ、{$P$}。\nなんか気づかない？　ほら、この服とか……ほら！", "zh": "对、各种各样的。话说，{$P$}。\n你没发现什么吗？你看，这件衣服之类的……你看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0454_1006_p", "source_sha256": "0d963ed0edef7a6a6b15b9e95a2024ef7723fbaeacdf4ef2f06ce422f8cb8682", "ja": "服……あっ！　もしかして、買うか迷ってた服か？\nちょっと前に、そんな相談してきたよな。", "zh": "衣服……啊！该不会是你之前纠结要不要买的那件衣服吧？\n就在不久前，你来找我商量过这事来着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0454_1007_034ayu", "source_sha256": "96a4e35c85b8a29e6690c2ecf8f6bf8abbd23bf1668e6007c8fdb4595facfc92", "ja": "そうそう！　{$P$}に\n背中押してもらったやつ！", "zh": "对对！就是{$P$}帮我下定决心买的那件！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0454_1008_p", "source_sha256": "7f7a700dd2231c88c58be3d97422fe6a399c71f6f6f589e9cb8ef57d9cda1489", "ja": "そうだったのか。相談の時は画像だったけど……\nすごくいいじゃないか！", "zh": "原来是这样。当时来找你商量的时候还是图片，不过……\n这不是很棒嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0454_1009_034ayu", "source_sha256": "5254a2352429409c06f608ac29f91a17c1814060d1e69707128adbce1ddca758", "ja": "でしょ～！　服に合わせて、髪型とか靴とか考えてさ。\nメチャクチャ楽しかったな～♪", "zh": "对吧～！我还配合衣服，考虑了发型和鞋子什么的。\n真的超级开心啊～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0454_1010_034ayu", "source_sha256": "76d16c24bc15b31cdeee49dd7b7fc1dae83526dd5bd4354c4bf99335df3bf8ca", "ja": "普段はあんまり選ばない感じの服だったから、\nアタシの可能性が広がった気もするよ。", "zh": "因为是平时不太会选的那种风格，\n感觉自己的可能性也拓宽了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0454_1011_p", "source_sha256": "9cf1760502c420ba95597685be8e767f35b966f00c95ef4e03c010f288b9cf14", "ja": "そうだな。いつもとは違った雰囲気があって、\nでもよく似合ってて……うん、素敵だと思うよ。", "zh": "是啊。感觉和平时不太一样，但很适合你……嗯，我觉得很棒。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0454_1012_034ayu", "source_sha256": "8816f1b36e1f0929629bd7e159e9a44be8ded4f8b88f2f97a169aa1f26af405e", "ja": "ホント！？　えへへ。……また迷った時は\n{$P$}に相談してもいい？", "zh": "真的！？　嘿嘿……下次又犹豫的时候，可以找{$P$}商量吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0454_1013_034ayu", "source_sha256": "f979da34d6772415433f2ae6de7ceb377f8c8bf97df627e72bcea6f81a939d1f", "ja": "ほら。普段からアタシ達の衣装を選んでるでしょ？\nだから、すっごく信用してる♪", "zh": "你看。平时不都是你在帮我们挑选服装吗？\n所以，我特别信任你♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0454_1014_034ayu", "source_sha256": "77f11b1d583c3765dd5e181bf7e71303fb94f6b0baac78e7991190921f85b666", "ja": "それに、アタシの知らないアタシを、引き出してくれて\n……可能性を広げてくれるんじゃないかなーって。", "zh": "而且，你还能发掘出我自己都不知道的另一面……\n我觉得，你一定能帮我拓展更多可能性吧——。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0454_1015_p", "source_sha256": "d0625207a1bcd1746ae2ba58858eb9e39ec669b03a89d557bc37790e6d0267a5", "ja": "歩……。", "zh": "步……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0454_1016_034ayu", "source_sha256": "48421cdd9d2c2b2761e5a66f12bffda5de19aa90cce5162fba0afd213f5c99e4", "ja": "自分でもちゃんと考えるよ。でも本当に迷った時は、\n相談させてほしいんだ。……ダメ、かな？", "zh": "我自己也会好好考虑的。不过真的感到迷茫时，能让我来找你商量吗？……不行吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0454_1017_p", "source_sha256": "6f4977f30b3313b4551de151d73597e6eaf2622a4808f826182c5c1405ff9006", "ja": "いや、ダメじゃないよ。歩の力になるためにいるんだ。\nいつでも相談にきてくれ！", "zh": "不，怎么会不行呢。我就是为了成为步的助力而存在的。\n随时来找我商量吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0454_1018_034ayu", "source_sha256": "4163247489a98950539d24ffbcf8f05fc51f402924ef97c4cf6d31b7d923d82a", "ja": "ありがとう、{$P$}……。\nそれじゃ、あとで次の相談するね♪", "zh": "谢谢你，{$P$}……\n那我晚点再来找你商量下一件事哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0454_1019_p", "source_sha256": "00583627f9804c42220157ca2ce92e4ad37a175c0fce4cae0789b20990d88919", "ja": "えっ？　もう？", "zh": "诶？已经要走了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0454_1020_034ayu", "source_sha256": "9a0442d94d265b28e342def901c415146d245e94fe91a05d9d20c83ebbae7b72", "ja": "へへ、また新しいアタシとの出会い、楽しみだな～。\n今日の仕事もがんばるぞー！　イエーイ！", "zh": "嘿嘿，又能遇见崭新的自己，好期待啊～。\n今天的工作也要加油——耶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
